  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Start your business - Start-programs NUTEK/TVV</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Start-programmen NUTEK/TVV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Start programmen erbjuder svenska sm&#xe5; och medelstora f&#xf6;retag m&#xf6;jligheten att ans&#xf6;ka om finansiellt st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r investeringar i kompetens&#xf6;verf&#xf6;ring och utrustning vid etablering i utvecklingsl&#xe4;nder i Afrika, Asien och Latinamerika eller i ett land i &#xd6;steuropa (ej EU).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Startup programs offer Swedish small and medium-sized companies the opportunity to apply for financial aid for investment in skills transfer and equipment at the establishment in developing countries in Africa, Asia and Latin America or in a country in Eastern Europe (non EU).</narrative>
  </description>
